236| \begin{proof}
237| 每往返一次，振幅乘以 $R\eu^{\iu\varphi}$（相差一个常相位）；透射振幅为 $t^2a\sum(R\eu^{\iu\varphi})^k =
238| t^2a/(1 - R\eu^{\iu\varphi})$，其中 $t^2 = 1 - R$；其模方为 $(1 - R)^2/
239| (1 - 2R\cos\varphi + R^2) = (1 - R)^2/[(1 - R)^2 + 4R\sin^2(\varphi/2)]$。峰值位于
240| $\varphi = 2\pi p$；半高处满足 $F\sin^2(\varphi/2) = 1$，即 $\Delta\varphi \approx
241| 4/\sqrt F = 2(1 - R)/\sqrt R$，而相邻峰之间相隔 $2\pi$。
242| \end{proof}
